WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.779
This is the right upper jaw, cut through the big back tooth.

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:07.414
Above the roots is the sinus, an air space in the cheekbone.

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:10.859
In some people, the roots reach up into the sinus.

00:00:11.659 --> 00:00:15.563
Taking out such a tooth can leave a hole into the sinus (an OAC).

00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:18.860
If it stays open, a lining grows inside,

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.419
and it becomes a lasting tunnel (an OAF).

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:25.035
A small hole may heal by itself under a blood clot.

00:00:25.835 --> 00:00:28.118
Bigger holes are closed with a flap of gum.

00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:31.796
If drinks come out of your nose after an upper tooth comes out,

00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:32.905
contact your dentist.
